- calls with HRs for "just to have a 30 minutes blah-blah-blah" (I have a prepared list of questions, and I hope you have prepared too);
- if I have no word from you at any of the stages for more than a week - I am not more interested in the job;
- I may consider test tasks only for tech lead or CTO roles, and it should be prepaid (for free you may have a look at my github and linkedin).
