2D/3D Motion Designer | ID: 939f1812-1ee5-5c6d-adb6-2aff949f8cb0
Primary Keyword: Design
English Level: upper
Experience Years: 5.0
More info: My main working experience is connected with:
— Cinema 4D + Octane;
— Adobe After Effects;
— Adobe Photoshop;
— Adobe Illustrator;

I have a solid experience in:
— low poly and high poly hard-surface modeling;
— lighting, texturing & rendering;
— 3D animation;
— post-production;
— Instagram grid design;
— animations for social networks;
— video editing;
— poster design for music events;
— Creating Lottie files
— Creating Google Ads ( Google Web Designer or Adobe Animate )

I have a basic knowledge and little experience in:
— 3D animation, rigging and simulations (Cinema 4D);
— creating and animating characters (Cinema 4D)
— UV mapping (RizomUV);
— texturing (Substance Painter);

I keep an eye on new technologies that may simplify or improve overall workflow and pipeline. Right now I'm interested in learning Marvelous Designer

I am a 100% team player. My ideal position is where I can be multifunctional and use my various skills on different production levels.

Skills
Adobe Photoshop, Adobe Illustrator, Adobe After Effects, Google Web Designer, Adobe Animate, Cinema 4D, Photoshop, Illustrator, graphic design, typography, Instagram, SMM, 
 After Effects, Octane, Marvelous Designer, Substance, Brainstorming, 3D animation, Figma

Highlights
I am proud of being self-taught: everything I am able to do in motion graphics and 3D is a result of hundreds of hours of self-education: tutorials, video courses, articles — you name it.

Looking for
I want to feel that I am a valuable member of a team, where creativity is a must and extraordinary ideas get reviewed no matter what.

I want a team with flexible work schedule, love for memes and understanding, that the best result we can get is only working hand-in-hand, brainstorming, testing different variants, i.e. experimenting a lot.

An English-speaking environment will only light up a fire in my eyes.

I want to have a mentor — a wise professional that will help to develop my weak skills alongside with upgrading my strengths. I want to feel his interest in my growth, because overall result always depends on team's level.

Really interested in working with NFTs.
