• Held personal exhibitions of paintings called Heat Engine in Odessa and Dnipro in 2015;
• Drew a series of illustrations for a scientific journal on sociology, which made it possible to present complex scientific material in a more accessible form. Also some of my paintings were used for the covers of the magazine.
