Looking For: I'd like to work with creating an idea of animation, development of the scenario, making a Illustrations and animation in 2D or 3D. Also I really enjoy visual effects, sounding and editing the animation.
Primary Keyword: Artist
English Level: upper
Experience Years: 2.0
More info: I have been working as a freelance illustrator and animator since 2018 by painting postcards, illustrations and making animations to order;
