• Made a cartoon based on the lullaby by Ukrainian writer Galina Budilova;

• Took a part of creation  (development of the idea and the story, animation) in a pair with illustrator Maria Guryanova of the cartoon based on the comic book "#БЕЗФІЛЬТРІВ" by Inna Sidko for the company "Little Beetle" (in my CV you can find a link to this video in YouTube);

• Made a design and animation for audio tales, lullabies and lyrics for the company "Little Beetle Press".

I use such programs as Adobe Photoshop, Adobe After Effects, Adobe Illustrator, Adobe Animate, Procreate, Cinema 4D (Octane). Familiar with Autodesk Maya and Blender.

Passed the Skvot course of Motion Design and got a diploma (score was 190 of 200 points for hw).
Highlights: For me, I am pride of being participated in such cool projects like making a cartoon of lullaby and video clip, working in pair with illustrator of creation a cartoon based on comics, and the last my project was to make a design and animation for audio tales, lyrics and lullabies (it is a charity project and by buying this audio clips the customers can donate for our army).
